        "edit": "Replace the level-sensitive latch (always @(clk) q = d) with a positive-edge-triggered flip-flop (always @(posedge clk) q <= d) so q updates only on the clock edge, matching the oracle's cycle-0 x and one-cycle-delayed data behavior.",
